OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers around first
OL,6,Fthing, but these will quickly fade
OL,7,Fleaving a largely dry day with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Lighter winds with
OL,9,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly cloudy evening with
OL,12,Fsome clear skies developing in the
OL,13,Fsouth of the region. Winds becoming
OL,14,Flight and variable but breezy along
OL,15,Fthe coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FTurning cloudy with some sunny
OL,18,Fspells, especially during the
OL,19,Fafternoon and clearing skies
OL,20,Fovernight. Feeling very warm in light
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
